proposed","acceptance":"Server test: an empty pool with enough gold is topped up by 168 hours of rate and gold drops by the same amount; with no gold the plot shows decay from its first day in debt, is marked condemned until its debt passes 30 days of rate, then the row is deleted; full damage reads 0 percent; a reduced 16-per-hour plot charges 12.8 per hour, not 12."}
